// Title: Potentially Suspicious ASP.NET Compilation Via AspNetCompiler
// Rule ID: 9f50fe98-fe5c-4a2d-86c7-fad7f63ed622
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1127
// Category: process_creation
